      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَامٌ سَامِكٌ</span></b>  <i>A high,</i> (S, TA,) or <i>long and high,
and plump,</i> (TA,) <i>camel's hump.</i> (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
